  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "室內設計史",
    "sub_ename": "HISTORY OF INTERIOR DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要在討論從工業革命後在室內設計及其相關家具設施的發展歷程。在本課程中，我們所關切的是室內設計風格的發展脈絡，其相關文化與時代背景的關係，以及設計大師及其作品的呈現。尤其是如何看待室內設計與藝術、流行和科技等不同領域之間的發展與影響。本課程要求學生熟悉該時期室內設計的風格主義、設計大師與代表作品，並且能夠查詢與閱讀相關設計作品及論述。",
    "describe_eh": "This course mainly discusses the development of interior design and related furniture facilities after the industrial revolution. In this course, we are concerned about the context of interior design style, the relationship between its related culture and the background of the times, and the presentation of design masters and their works. Especially how to look at the development and influence between interior design and art, fashion and technology. This course requires students to be familiar with interior design styles, design masters and representative works of the period, and be able to inquire and read related design works and theories.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "對於室內設計風格的發展脈絡、設計大師及其作品能夠有充足的認識。學生能夠區分室內設計風格中如：新藝術、風格派、包浩斯、國際式樣等在作品上的特色，增進對於室內設計發展之國際觀。",
      "describe_en": "Sufficient Comprehension of the development context of interior design, design masters and their works. Students can distinguish the characteristics of the works in interior design styles, such as Art Nouveau, De Stijl, Bauhaus, and international style…etc., and enhance the international view on the development of interior design."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "思考室內設計史在空間設計過程中的重要性，同時透過課程的訓練，能將所學應用在室內設計上。",
      "describe_en": "Consideration of the importance of interior design history in the process of spatial design, and application of what they have learned through course training into interior design."
    }
  ],
